{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲食節目《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾深入港九新界，由多位主持走訪三間備受推崇的特色美食店家。從元朗在地名士帶路的頂級騸牯牛腩與秘製牛雜，到灣仔網民力推的極致黑芝麻主題烘焙甜點，再到尖沙咀提供逾50款食材自由搭配的客製化爆餡三文治，為大家帶來多元豐富的飲食體驗！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由元朗在地名士鄧達智帶著行仔開展美食巡禮，造訪位於元朗大陂頭、深受街坊喜愛的鮮牛肉名店：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新彪記清湯牛腩（分店）</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：元朗大陂頭徑12-24號福星樓地下7號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e7ef0c25-d384-4a3d-8c57-b31726ad0e97.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026YIoWan3kIq1791169607.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e7ef0c25-d384-4a3d-8c57-b31726ad0e97.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b8bbfa25-d6cf-4159-9c99-fbce6ad7df66.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026eRIg8O8we41791169607.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b8bbfa25-d6cf-4159-9c99-fbce6ad7df66.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6d56b5b4-2b8b-4a5c-adc4-8b4abe09ba91.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026t7vYs6rWfB1791169609.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6d56b5b4-2b8b-4a5c-adc4-8b4abe09ba91.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"debeefe8-ab36-49cf-bad2-1125fade1851.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026ZPZ7MAtaPS1791169609.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"debeefe8-ab36-49cf-bad2-1125fade1851.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"34a2123f-8408-4eb1-bc47-75b9340d32ba.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260LqtXeTTMM1791169610.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"34a2123f-8408-4eb1-bc47-75b9340d32ba.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d050a2dc-1dc7-4952-9c9d-e53c0a558b73.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20263DuBkjr0671791169608.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d050a2dc-1dc7-4952-9c9d-e53c0a558b73.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">林映暉與波波（黃婧靈）來到灣仔一間備受網民力推的人氣烘焙店，這裡以黑芝麻主題烘焙甜點為主打：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Soft Thunder</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：灣仔皇后大道東31號地下B號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6815bdf4-803b-4630-966f-57fd8b9c6ff8.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026mBWkG9H8um1791169608.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6815bdf4-803b-4630-966f-57fd8b9c6ff8.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c5968249-38c0-453e-bc47-0a3c540696dd.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20261gKzY2ZRkL1791169611.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c5968249-38c0-453e-bc47-0a3c540696dd.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8a2322a5-36c4-4f84-b27a-4f829cc6db38.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026lMY38j3SCn1791169612.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8a2322a5-36c4-4f84-b27a-4f829cc6db38.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃嘉雯與廖慧儀造訪尖沙咀一間話題度極高的三文治專門店，店家提供超過50種豐富食材，讓顧客可根據個人喜好自由選擇麵包種類與餡料，輕鬆打造健康低負擔或極致邪惡的客製化爆餡三文治：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">SANDWICHOLOGY</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：尖沙咀緬甸臺凱譽地下17號鋪</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b8706a05-3600-4e04-a9bf-59de50702e1f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026oBSZvHI6Zf1791169610.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b8706a05-3600-4e04-a9bf-59de50702e1f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb6ab3f4-b05c-4838-b453-14cfc866556c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Hp8JP6xdg41791169611.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb6ab3f4-b05c-4838-b453-14cfc866556c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e6555be3-4a50-4d14-8fd6-3336eb85496e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dHa5oe636B1791169610.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e6555be3-4a50-4d14-8fd6-3336eb85496e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T06:58:18.476661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":410,"images":12,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}